'''Judgment''' (ジャッジメント) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy appearing in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Judgment
|image = E 463.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 500¢ - 1975¢
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy that can act as a threat if the player isn't careful. It supports high health at 180,000 and moderately high damage at 13,000. It has multi-hit which separates the enemies damage into two attacks and a guaranteed chance to [[Slow|slow]] Cat Units.

==Strategy==
Units such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], its [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic counterpart]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], etc are able to outrange this enemy and take him out with ease.

